{"id":88775672076228,"name":"Survive from all Siren Heads 2","desc":"This game is inspired by Midnight Horrors.\n\nThis game is different and similar to the original game \"Survive From all Siren Heads\" but this game has better siren heads, more maps, and more gamepasses and much more!\n\nThis game is about surviving different versions of siren heads. whenever the intermission ends, a random siren head will spawn in to hunt at a random target. once the timer is done, the siren head will be gone, and the intermission starts again. there is a chance a special round would begin. A new map will sometimes change. \n\nThese siren heads are from the marketplace, my remakes, and siren heads I got permission from my friends.\n\nCredits to all people who owns a siren head model and it's in my game!\n\nShutdown = Update\n\nDon't forget to...\n\nLike\nFavorite\nAnd follow.","path":"/game/88775672076228-survive-from-all-siren-heads-2","slug":"88775672076228-survive-from-all-siren-heads-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/a13bc223bdb2eef455a9b96a1becfda1323105ca2410c7134f5a53631340127a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6582549ad9b7b17d5c4528fb1c7f6b82/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":24,"visitor":2925309,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-19T23:09:07.449Z","creator":{"name":"Siren Head Morphs Group","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Survive-from-all-Siren-Heads-2-become-sirenhead-76240","_id":"6945db135e6c74e9c1b0a072","title":"become sirenhead","game":{"_id":"6945db135e6c74e9c1b0a06d","gameId":88775672076228,"name":"Survive from all Siren Heads 2","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":88775672076228},"features":"Allows you to become siren head and kill people","tags":["Siren head","Sirenhead","Become","Morph","Kill